  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The standard Python library for creating standards-compliant derived DICOM objects (segmentations, structured reports, parametric maps) — MIT, NCI-backed, 225 stars, 46 releases. Assess rather than Adopt due to lower star count and niche scope (primarily relevant for teams storing AI/ML analysis results back into DICOM). Essential for any pipeline that needs to write DICOM SR or SEG objects interoperably.",
